Patch 16: 5195f8a41928 — "io_uring: check def->plug separately from needing file"
================================================================================

Separation of concerns: the old code used def->needs_file as a proxy for needing
plugging. Since slot IOs don't need a file but do need plugging, these two
concepts need to be independent.

Before this patch, the plugging logic was tied to needs_file:

  if (def->needs_file) {
          // plugging logic
  }

After, they are split into two separate checks:

  if (def->plug) {
          // plugging logic
  }
  if (def->needs_file) {
          // file handling logic
  }

Slot IOs (IORING_OP_SLOT_RW) set .plug = true but .needs_file = false.
Normal read/write IOs have both .plug = true and .needs_file = true.

